# How to use this lesson

Lesson 49 derived Feynman rules from the Dyson series. This lesson derives the same rules from Z=∫Dφ e^{iS_0} e^{iS_int}. The point is the match, not a new process. Expect four to six hours.

## Learning objectives

- Expand e^{iS_int} as a power series in e.

- Contract fields in pairs using the free Gaussian (Wick).

- Read +ieγ^μ off S_int=e ψ̄γ^μψ A_μ, matching Lesson 44.

- Obtain a minus sign for each closed fermion loop from Grassmann integration.

